Adapt OpenTUI build.zig for Zig 0.16.0.
lang/zig on OpenBSD provides 0.16.0; upstream opentui v0.3.4
targets 0.15.2.  The build system API between these versions
changed significantly (methods moved from Step.Compile to
root_module, new function signatures for linkFramework/linkSystemLibrary,
graph.host renamed, env_map replaced, etc.).

The uucode vendored dependency also needs a one-line fix:
s/b.modules.put(b.dupe("uucode")/b.modules.put(b.allocator, b.dupe("uucode")/
in zig-pkg/uucode-*/build.zig.  This cannot be done in a static
patch because the package is fetched and hashed by the Zig build
system.  As a workaround, extract the uucode tarball manually,
apply the fix, and pass --system uucode=/path/to/patched/uucode
to zig build.

